; Show a visited location: its name and the lists, without the picture
;
; The short description of a location the player has seen before (the long one
; is #R$9630): prints the location's name as words (#R$9689), a new line, and
; continues in #R$965B with the obstacles, the exits and the objects here.
; .
; Hardware: none.
;
; A Location id
@label=DescribeLocationShort
c$96A8 CALL $9BB1           ; IX = the record
 $96AB CALL $9689           ; name only (no description message, no picture)
 $96AE CALL $8583           ; new line
 $96B1 JR $967F             ; ShowLocation_Lists
